    "两种方式产出同一份 PDF 讲义：claude 按内置 skill 生成，或用已配置的 API 接口按同一 skill 生成、在本机编译。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both channels produce the same PDF lecture notes: claude follows the bundled skill, or your configured API endpoint follows the same skill and the result compiles locally."
          }
        }
      }
    },
